# yaml-language-server: $schema=https://aka.ms/winget-manifest.defaultLocale.1.28.0.schema.json

PackageIdentifier: degoya.rBrowser
PackageVersion: @VERSION@
PackageLocale: en-US
Publisher: DEGOYA.digital
PublisherUrl: https://github.com/@OWNER@
PublisherSupportUrl: https://github.com/@REPOSITORY@/issues
PackageName: rBrowser
PackageUrl: https://github.com/@REPOSITORY@
License: GPL-3.0-or-later
LicenseUrl: https://github.com/@REPOSITORY@/blob/v@VERSION@/LICENSE
ShortDescription: Development browser that shows every breakpoint of a site at once
Description: |-
  rBrowser shows every breakpoint of a site at once, in one window with a freely configurable
  grid of Chromium views. Navigation, scrolling, clicks, input, keyboard and hover are replayed
  in every view; Firefox and WebKit windows join the same session. The breakpoint setup lives in
  the project, so a team shares it, and a built-in MCP server and a Playwright endpoint let AI
  agents and tests drive every view. Installed through winget it does not replace itself: update
  it with `winget upgrade degoya.rBrowser`.
Moniker: rbrowser
Tags:
- breakpoints
- browser
- developer-tools
- mcp
- playwright
- responsive-design
- web-development
